    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inverted Journey is a mind-bending puzzle platformer all about seeing things from a new perspective. You play as a girl that recently gained the power to enter the negative space of the levels around her. You'll have to use this unique ability to solve strange puzzles, collect hidden treasures, and journey on a quest to save your little brother from a terrible fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Traverse 40+ levels full of unique puzzles and mind-bending solutions<br></li><li> Enjoy a simple, cute story and clean minimalist art<br></li><li> Find deviously hidden secret stars for fun and bragging rights</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/7e32883092957cafa9d6c51f1d5be68f.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inverted Journey is a mind-bending puzzle platformer all about seeing things from a new perspective. You play as a girl that recently gained the power to enter the negative space of the levels around her. You'll have to use this unique ability to solve strange puzzles, collect hidden treasures, and journey on a quest to save your little brother from a terrible fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/4daae8a6b05e504ce584773793feb15f.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Traverse 40+ levels full of unique puzzles and mind-bending solutions<br></li><li> Enjoy a simple, cute story and clean minimalist art<br></li><li> Find deviously hidden secret stars for fun and bragging rights</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.poster.avif?t=1737406201\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.webm?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883130/extras/35ca841e80bdae3a465c3f691395a205.mp4?t=1737406201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
